Z||000000||mrtgman||10-10-2001||11:37 PM||||Well you know what I mean. Pegged all the way to the left. Do I need to replace the gauge or is there an electrical fix? It's an 86 gt if it matters.<P>Thanks<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.palmbeachloan.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.palmbeachloan.com</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||My7Fieros||10-11-2001||01:41 AM||||Your temp sending unit has shitt itself. Replace it....rear side of the engine (trunk side), lower left corner of valve cover...easy fix and cost around 20 bucks (as usual) at AutoZone. Had to do it on several of mine..........<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="blue"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||1
